WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.589 --> 00:00:07.674
My name is Mike Degen.

00:00:07.674 --> 00:00:09.009
I’m 46.

00:00:09.009 --> 00:00:11.428
My Manulife &lt;i&gt;Vitality&lt;/i&gt; age is 45,

00:00:11.428 --> 00:00:13.513
and I’ve been a member for 8 years.

00:00:13.513 --> 00:00:16.474
Initially, I was looking
for life insurance.

00:00:16.474 --> 00:00:19.310
Through word of mouth,
we found the Manulife &lt;i&gt;Vitality&lt;/i&gt; product.

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:22.605
I discovered that Manulife &lt;i&gt;Vitality&lt;/i&gt;
wasn’t just life insurance.

00:00:22.605 --> 00:00:25.066
It had gamification built into it,

00:00:25.066 --> 00:00:29.529
where my weekly reward points
could give me a points tally.

00:00:29.529 --> 00:00:32.240
It could give me opportunities
to win gift cards.

00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:34.909
And that became fun,
and later on, important.

00:00:34.909 --> 00:00:38.705
What might start with a walk for me
to get my active rewards

00:00:38.705 --> 00:00:40.290
is now turned into a walk run.

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:42.876
Those walk runs have turned
into all-out runs,

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:45.879
So, it becomes a little bit less
about the program

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:49.758
and more about how I’m getting
the benefits out of it.

00:00:49.758 --> 00:00:53.428
This is all stemming
from just life insurance,

00:00:53.428 --> 00:00:56.556
which I think is kind of crazy
to think about how life insurance

00:00:56.556 --> 00:00:58.266
has made me more active

00:00:58.266 --> 00:01:00.643
and made me choose healthier choices.

00:01:00.643 --> 00:01:02.645
Would I recommend
the Manulife &lt;i&gt;Vitality&lt;/i&gt; product?

00:01:02.645 --> 00:01:04.314
I would 100% recommend it.

00:01:04.314 --> 00:01:08.651
It became just a way of life,
a lifestyle change.

00:01:08.651 --> 00:01:12.405
Healthier choices became organic
just as a result of just being

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:16.159
held accountable and
wanting to do it for what started out 

00:01:16.159 --> 00:01:18.536
at first the product,
but then for myself

00:01:18.536 --> 00:01:19.704
and then for my family.

